Ross?

259
00:14:02,100 --> 00:14:03,060
Ja?

260
00:14:03,100 --> 00:14:07,070
Ja.

261
00:14:07,110 --> 00:14:08,070
Oh Mann.

262
00:14:08,110 --> 00:14:10,010
